<LegalLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy" 
  description="Privacy Policy for Bangladesh Travel Guide, detailing data handling, cookies, analytics, and third-party monetization practices."
  lastUpdated="October 18, 2026"
>
  <p>
    At Bangladesh Travel Guide (accessible from https://bangladeshtravelguide.com), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by Bangladesh Travel Guide and how we utilize it.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Server Log Files</h2>
  <p>
    Bangladesh Travel Guide follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. This data is used for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking user movement on the website, and gathering demographic information to ensure reliable site performance.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
  <p>
    Like any other website, Bangladesh Travel Guide uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Advertising Partners & Google AdSense</h2>
  <p>
    Some of advertisers on our site may use cookies and web beacons. When third-party ad networks or ad servers serve advertisements on our site, they may automatically receive your IP address. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.
  </p>
  <p>
    <em>Note: Bangladesh Travel Guide has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.</em>
  </p>

  <h2>4. Affiliate Links and Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    Our website contains contextual affiliate links to external travel service providers (such as hotel booking platforms, eSIM services, or tour operators). Clicking on an affiliate link may set a tracking cookie on your browser to record referred transactions. Please review the individual privacy policies of third-party vendors for detailed information regarding their data practices.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
  <p>
    If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us through our dedicated <a href="/contact/">Contact Page</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>